# sweep: --bare
# A source chosen before the first refresh is the list the brief comes from,
# and the time it came reads as a time of day. What a restart reads back is
# checked by a_saved_brief_reads_back_with_its_source_and_its_time_after_a_restart,
# and on live sites by drive-source-restart.kobo.
wait-for Nothing yet
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
expect Top stories
expect Ask Hacker News
tap-id source-show
wait-idle
tap Brief
wait-for Show Hacker News selected. Refresh to fetch it.
clean
shot source-chosen
tap Refresh
# Saving every story for offline reading goes on behind the list, and takes
# as long as today's story sites do, so the route waits for the list only.
wait-for Show Hacker News · as of
expect-missing as of 20
clean
shot brief-show
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
clean
shot sources-chosen
